      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 816,
        "content": "## AI Lead Qualification Agent\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow collects new lead information through an n8n form, sends the submission to OpenAI for lead qualification, and parses the AI output into structured data. It then saves the qualified lead to Google Sheets and routes the lead by temperature, sending Telegram alerts for sales follow-up when applicable.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Configure the Lead Intake Form fields to capture the lead details needed for qualification, such as name, company, budget, timeline, and contact information.\n- Connect OpenAI credentials and review the prompt or model settings in the AI qualification node.\n- Set up Google Sheets credentials and select the target spreadsheet and sheet columns for saving parsed lead data.\n- Configure the switch rules for HOT, WARM, and COLD lead categories so they match the parsed AI qualification output.\n- Connect Telegram bot credentials and set the target chat or group for sales team alerts.\n\n### Customization\n\nAdjust the AI prompt, qualification scoring criteria, switch thresholds, Google Sheets columns, and Telegram message text to match your sales process."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
