    {
      "id": "573878f8-1cc6-4e90-b523-6b13d3a018b7",
      "name": "AI Lead Qualification",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.openAi",
      "position": [
        496,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "modelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "gpt-5-mini",
          "cachedResultName": "GPT-5-MINI"
        },
        "options": {},
        "responses": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are an AI sales lead qualification agent.\n\nAnalyze the following inbound lead.\n\nName: {{ $json.Name }}\nEmail: {{ $json.Email }}\nCompany: {{ $json.Company }}\nBudget: {{ $json.Budget }}\nNeed: {{ $json.Need }}\nUrgency: {{ $json.Urgency }}\nMessage: {{ $json.Message }}\n\nEvaluate the lead based on:\n- budget\n- urgency\n- clarity of business need\n- likelihood of purchasing\n- potential business value\n\nGive the lead a score from 0 to 100.\n\nClassification:\nHOT = 75-100\nWARM = 40-74\nCOLD = 0-39\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON. Do not add markdown, explanations, or ```json.\n\nUse exactly this structure:\n\n{\n  \"score\": 85,\n  \"classification\": \"HOT\",\n  \"reason\": \"Short explanation\",\n  \"recommended_action\": \"Short recommended next action\",\n  \"reply\": \"Short personalized reply to the lead\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": null,
          "name": "",
          "__aiGatewayManaged": true
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 2.3
    },
    {
      "id": "69d1cf46-3e03-4f90-baa4-99e976bd7508",
      "name": "Parse Qualification Results",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "position": [
        864,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "jsCode": "const raw = $json.output[0].content[0].text;\nconst result = JSON.parse(raw);\n\nconst lead = $('When Lead Form Submitted').item.json;\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    name: lead.Name,\n    email: lead.Email,\n    company: lead.Company || \"\",\n    budget: lead.Budget || \"\",\n    need: lead.Need,\n    urgency: lead.Urgency,\n    message: lead.Message || \"\",\n    submittedAt: lead.submittedAt,\n    ...result\n  }\n};"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
